## Title: K.T.H. |cff888888(Kill The Healer)|r

## Notes: Identifies healers in PvP battlegrounds and marks their nameplates with a visible indicator. Uses scoreboard-based healer detection and Class+PowerType nameplate matching, designed for WoW 12.0 (Midnight) where enemy names and GUIDs are secret values. Built on the H.H.T.D. framework by John Wellesz.

## Author: John Wellesz (original H.H.T.D.), Scone (Midnight adaptation)
## Version: 1.0.0-kth

## LoadManagers: AddonLoader

## X-LoadOn-Slash: /hhtd
## X-LoadOn-Always: delayed

## SavedVariables: HHTD_SavedVariables, KTH_NameplateSettings

